 "final_summary": "The bug was that open_count only counted tasks with status 'open', ignoring 'in_progress' and 'blocked' tasks. The fix changed open_count to total - finished (all unfinished tasks), which correctly includes all active tasks. The fix also preserved the average_priority calculation that was previously removed, ensuring all tests pass.",
